        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.711,
            0.743,
            0.785
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. A population is part of a community. If all decomposers suddenly disappear from a forest ecosystem, what changes do you think would occur? Explain why decomposers are essential."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.791,
            0.744,
            0.903
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Selvam from Cuddalore district, Tamil Nadu, shared that his village was less affected by the 2004 Tsunami compared to nearby villages due to the presence of mangrove forests. This surprised Sarita, Shabnam, and Shijo. They wondered if mangroves were protecting the village. Can you help them understand this?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.757,
            0.767,
            0.936,
            0.815
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fig. 12.19: Population, community, and ecosystem"
            }
          ]
        },
